      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Byrne Malone are delighted to bring Woodview to the market by private Treaty. Nestled in a peaceful countryside setting and surrounded by open green fields, this spacious three-bedroom detached bungalow offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the tranquillity of rural living while providing bright and spacious accommodation throughout, with potential to extend, subject to planning permission.\n\nApproached through a gated entrance, the property is set behind a generous gravel driveway, providing ample off-street parking. On entering, a bright timber-floored hallway immediately gives a welcoming feel and provides access to the accommodation.\n\nTo the right of the hallway is a spacious sitting room, featuring timber flooring, an open fireplace and a large amount of natural light, creating a comfortable and inviting space for relaxing.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a generous kitchen/dining room, which is very much the heart of the home. The room is filled with natural light and features timber flooring, ample storage and a log-burning stove, making it an ideal space for everyday family living and dining. The kitchen also provides access to a useful utility area, which in turn leads directly out to the rear garden.\n\nMoving through the hallway, there are three bright and spacious double bedrooms, each offering excellent proportions and plenty of natural light. A beautifully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys a lovely countryside setting, with open green fields providing a peaceful backdrop. The gated entrance and generous pebble driveway offer excellent parking, while the rear garden provides a private outdoor space with plenty of potential for enjoying the surrounding rural setting.\n\nThe property also offers excellent potential to extend, subject to the necessary planning permission, providing the new owners with the opportunity to adapt and further develop the accommodation to suit their own needs.\n\nThe property is ideally positioned for those commuting, with convenient access to the N7 three-lane carriageway and M9 motorway. There are regular bus services available from nearby Naas, while Sallins Train Station offers excellent commuter rail connections to Dublin City Centre, including Heuston Station and Grand Canal Dock.\n\nThe surrounding area offers a superb choice of sporting and recreational facilities, with a wide range of clubs and amenities catering for GAA, rugby, soccer, hockey, tennis, athletics, leisure activities, horse riding and golf. The area is also synonymous with horse racing, with Punchestown Racecourse, Naas Racecourse and The Curragh Racecourse all within easy reach\n\nOverall, this is a lovely detached bungalow in a truly peaceful location, offering spacious and practical accommodation with the added appeal of countryside living. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
